  "description": "<div>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: left; font-size: 14px; font-weight: normal;\">&bull; Brand introduction: We are Blue Bolt Creative a two teacher owned and operated company that does all the design and printing in house. We have been designing and selling shirts designed specifically for teachers for over 7 years and with Blue Bolt Creative we are expanding out to a more general targeted audience.&nbsp;&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: left; font-size: 14px; font-weight: normal;\">With our Ricoh Ri1000 DTG machine, SawGrass sublimation printer, Six arm manual screen press, heat presses, tumbler presses, conveyor dryers and etcher we can also make any custom orders for your school, club, business, organization, etc.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: left; font-size: 14px; font-weight: normal;\"><br>&bull; Product description: Our vibrant and eye-catchign designs are printed on Bella Canvas blanks.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: left; font-size: 14px; font-weight: normal;\"><br>&bull; USP (Unique Selling Point): As teachers with a background in graphic design and printing we value QUALITY and PRICING and can give that individual customer service that the big guys and the POD services CANNOT.</p>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: left; font-size: 14px; font-weight: normal;\">&bull; Payment terms:&nbsp; Commission payouts sent via Paypal or Venmo each month.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: left; font-size: 14px; font-weight: normal;\"><br>&bull; Other information: Being a small business we can focus on the individual needs of each affiliate marketer and share our experiences of where/how we have had success to be able to grow it from the ground up.&nbsp;</p>\r\n</div>",
